# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of platform or local
# core.autocrlf settings. Without this, Windows checkouts store CRLF bytes
# while Linux (CI) checkouts store LF bytes for the exact same commit --
# scripts/bump_versions.py hashes raw file bytes, so that mismatch made every
# asset look "changed" on GitHub Actions even when nothing actually changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
